# 🎮 3D FPS Maze Game

A 3D first-person maze shooter developed using **Python and OpenGL (PyOpenGL)**. The game combines maze exploration, combat, resource management, enemy AI, and a final boss battle across four progressively challenging levels.

## 🕹️ Features

* 🎯 First-person shooting gameplay
* 🧩 Multiple maze-based levels
* 👾 Different enemy types:

  * Sentry Turrets
  * Chaser Enemies
  * Final Boss
* 🔫 Player shooting and ammunition system
* ❤️ Health and damage system
* 📦 Health and ammunition pickups
* 🔑 Keycard collection system
* 🚪 Locked portals for level progression
* 🔥 Lava hazards
* 💥 Bullet and particle/spark effects
* 🗺️ Real-time minimap
* 👁️ Inspection/third-person camera mode
* 🏆 Score system
* ⚔️ Multi-phase boss battle
* 🔄 Restart and game-over system

## 📌 Game Levels

### Level 1 — Sentry Maze

Navigate through the maze while fighting automated sentry turrets. Find the hidden keycard and use it to unlock the portal.

### Level 2 — Hunter Corridors

Face fast-moving chaser enemies while navigating a more complex maze.

### Level 3 — Crossfire Labyrinth

A larger and more challenging maze containing both turrets and chaser enemies.

### Level 4 — Lava Core Boss

Enter the final arena containing lava hazards and fight the final boss to complete the mission.

## 🎮 Controls

| Key                  | Action                   |
| -------------------- | ------------------------ |
| `W`                  | Move forward             |
| `S`                  | Move backward            |
| `A`                  | Strafe left              |
| `D`                  | Strafe right             |
| `Q`                  | Turn left                |
| `E`                  | Turn right               |
| `Arrow Left`         | Turn left                |
| `Arrow Right`        | Turn right               |
| `Arrow Up`           | Look up                  |
| `Arrow Down`         | Look down                |
| `Space`              | Shoot                    |
| `Left Mouse Button`  | Shoot                    |
| `C`                  | Toggle inspection camera |
| `Right Mouse Button` | Toggle inspection camera |
| `R`                  | Restart game             |

