## 🎓 Academic Project

This project was developed as a computer graphics/game development project to demonstrate practical concepts including:

* 3D transformations
* Camera systems
* OpenGL rendering
* Collision detection
* Basic enemy AI
* Projectile physics
* Game state management
* Animation
* Lighting-free primitive-based modeling
* HUD and minimap rendering

